    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scătūrīgĭnes</span></b> ,
			um, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gushing</i> or <i>bubbling waters</i>, <i>spring-water</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 44,
			33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Front. Aquaed. 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in nigrā (terrā)
